      Integer *4 DEBUG /0/

      real *4 zfirst/-283./

      real *4 zlast/-57.4/

      real *4 DextThk/0.1/

      real *4 DextSupLen/0.4/

      real *4 DextLen/1.4/

      real *4 DextOutRad/7.5/

